      "methods-erp"
    ],
    "engineering_link": "脑干听觉通路反应（如听性脑干反应 ABR）是临床与神经工程中经典的时序与通路完整性评估指标。",
    "references": [
      {
        "type": "textbook",
        "title": "The Human Brain: An Introduction to its Functional Anatomy (Nolte, 7th ed.)",
